-Level Matters\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-5 font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"There’s no shortage of AI security content on the internet. Most of it falls into two categories: theoretical frameworks that don’t tell you what to actually do, and enterprise-scale programs that assume you have a 20-person security team and a seven-figure budget.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"AITrustAudit.com is built for the practitioner in the middle — the security professional adding AI to their toolkit, the GRC team trying to figure out how AI breaks their existing compliance program, the SMB operator who knows they have a problem and needs a pragmatic path to fixing it.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Every piece of content, every template, every audit methodology on this site is designed to be usable in the real world — in a client engagement, in a compliance review, in a conversation with leadership at 9am on a Tuesday.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"That’s the standard. Useful in practice, not just in theory.\\\"}]]}]]}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-light-bg py-16 px-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Where to Start\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L10\\\",\\\"/course\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/course\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-divider hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\\\",\\\"children\\\":[