"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Security practitioners adding AI to their threat model. GRC and compliance teams whose existing frameworks don't cover LLMs. Security engineers building or securing AI-powered systems. Anyone who needs to understand AI risk at a practitioner level — not just in theory.\"}]]}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-navy py-20 px-4 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"opacity\":0.08}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"section-label mb-4\",\"children\":\"// FRAMEWORKS & STANDARDS\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-white text-2xl font-bold mb-8\",\"children\":\"The Curriculum Is Grounded in the Standards That Matter\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"NIST AI RMF 1.0\",{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal/40 text-teal-lt hover:border-teal-lt transition-colors\",\"children\":\"NIST AI RMF 1.0\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"OWASP LLM Top 10\",{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal/40 text-teal-lt hover:border-teal-lt transition-colors\",\"children\":\"OWASP LLM Top 10\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"ISO/IEC 42001\",{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal/40 text-teal-lt hover:border-teal-lt transition-colors\",\"children\":\"ISO/IEC 42001\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"NIST CSF 2.0\",{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal/40 text-teal-lt hover:border-teal-lt transition-colors\",\"children\":\"NIST CSF 2.0\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"HIPAA Security Rule\",{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal/40 text-teal-lt hover:border-teal-lt transition-colors\",\"children\":\"HIPAA Security Rule\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"GDPR\",{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal/40 text-teal-lt hover:border-teal-lt transition-colors\",\"children\":\"GDPR\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"SOC 2 Type II\",{\"className\":\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-teal/40 text-teal-lt hover:border-teal-lt transition-colors\",\"children\":\"SOC 2 Type II\"}]]}]]}]]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white py-20 px-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center mb-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"section-label mb-3\",\"children\":\"// THE MISSION\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-3xl font-bold\",\"children\":\"Why Practitioner-Level Matters\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-5 font-body text-mid-gray text-base leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"There’s no shortage of AI security content on the internet. Most of it falls into two categories: theoretical frameworks that don’t tell you what to actually do, and enterprise-scale programs that assume you have a 20-person security team and a seven-figure budget.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"AITrustAudit.com is built for the practitioner in the middle — the security professional adding AI to their toolkit, the GRC team trying to figure out how AI breaks their existing compliance program, the SMB operator who knows they have a problem and needs a pragmatic path to fixing it.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Every piece of content, every template, every audit methodology on this site is designed to be usable in the real world — in a client engagement, in a compliance review, in a conversation with leadership at 9am on a Tuesday.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"That’s the standard. Useful in practice, not just in theory.\"}]]}]]}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-light-bg py-16 px-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"Where to Start\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L10\",\"/course\",{\"href\":\"/course\",\"className\":\"block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-divider hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-1\",\"children\":\"The Course\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\",\"children\":\"8 modules, 35 lessons, certificate\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L10\",\"/free-risk-overview\",{\"href\":\"/free-risk-overview\",\"className\":\"block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-divider hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-1\",\"children\":\"Free Risk Overview\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\",\"children\":\"5 risks explained, free PDF\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L10\",\"/blog\",{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-divider hover:border-teal transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-navy text-sm font-bold mb-1\",\"children\":\"The Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\",\"children\":\"Frameworks, auditing, compliance\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"headline\":\"Ready to Build Your AI Security Skills?\",\"subhead\":\"Start with the free risk overview